Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: zfs-pay contributors
Recommends: zfsutils-linux, systemd
Suggests: ledmon
Enhances: zfsutils-linux
Homepage: https://github.com/zoujunkun/zfs-pay
Description: map OpenZFS vdevs to physical drive bays
 zfs-pay discovers ZFS leaf vdev identity, maps disks to controller or SES
 enclosure slots, and safely controls locate LEDs. It never changes pool or
 disk state and does not include proprietary controller utilities.
